[22.53, "o", "\u001b[2m[loom] turn 1: bobby (resumed, model=haiku) hears axe\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[24.58, "o", "\r\nStarting from the Peano axioms: 2 is defined as S(S(0)), so 2 + 2 =\r\n"]
[24.63, "o", "S(S(0)) + S(S(0)) = S(S(S(S(0)))) = 4. The claim holds by the\r\n"]
[24.73, "o", "recursive definition of addition.\r\n\r\n"]
[24.93, "o", "\u001b[2m[loom] 0:05 | $0.004 | 198 chars\u001b[0m\r\n"]
